# Normalise line endings.
#
# This repo is authored on Windows but every script runs inside a Linux
# container or on a CI runner. A shell script checked out with CRLF fails at
# the shebang with "bad interpreter: /usr/bin/env bash^M", and the failure is
# confusing because the file looks fine in an editor. Forcing LF on everything
# executable removes a whole class of "works on my machine" bug reports.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Must be LF — executed by a shell.
*.sh            text eol=lf
Dockerfile      text eol=lf
*.Dockerfile    text eol=lf

# Must be LF — parsed by Kubernetes / CI tooling.
*.yaml          text eol=lf
*.yml           text eol=lf
*.py            text eol=lf
*.json          text eol=lf
*.md            text eol=lf

# Binary: never touch.
*.png           binary
*.jpg           binary
*.jpeg          binary
*.gif           binary
*.pdf           binary
*.gz            binary
*.tar           binary
*.zip           binary
*.cast          binary
